% ============================================================
% references.bib — sample bibliography exercising both citation
% presets (authoryear / superscript).
%
% HOUSE RULES (guides/CITATIONS.md):
%   * Every entry carries `verified = {YYYY-MM-DD}` — the date a human
%     last confirmed the source says what we cite it for. biber does
%     not know this field; preamble/packages.tex drops it with a
%     \DeclareSourcemap so builds stay warning-free.
%   * Every @online entry carries urldate (when the URL was fetched)
%     in addition to verified (when the CLAIM was checked).
%   * Every url entry carries `archived = {Wayback snapshot URL}` —
%     verify_citation.py --archive fills it; the release gate
%     requires it. Also dropped by the sourcemap.
% ============================================================

